1. Incremental learning codebase of Zheng et al.
===============================================================================

Source : https://github.com/zzz47zzz/codebase-for-incremental-learning-with-llm
Authors: Junhao Zheng, Shengjie Qiu, and Qianli Ma
Paper  : Junhao Zheng, Shengjie Qiu, and Qianli Ma. Learn or Recall? Revisiting
         Incremental Learning with Pre-trained Language Models. In Proceedings of
         the 62nd Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics
         (ACL), 2024.

The following files are derived from this codebase and were modified for the
present work (training loop, evaluation interfaces, LM-head adaptation,
backbone loading, and bug fixes):

  main_CL.py
  models/__init__.py, models/Base.py, models/SEQ.py, models/DERpp.py,
  models/CLSER.py, models/L2KD.py, models/LAMOL.py, models/LAMOL_KD.py,
  models/PCLL.py, models/PEFT.py
  utils/backbone.py, utils/buffer.py, utils/classifier.py, utils/config.py,
  utils/dataformat_preprocess.py, utils/dataloader.py, utils/dataset.py,
  utils/download_backbones.py, utils/evaluation.py, utils/factory.py,
  utils/logger.py, utils/metric.py, utils/optimizer.py, utils/probing.py,
  utils/prompt.py, utils/wrapmodel.py
  config/ (method and dataset configuration files)
  scripts/preprocess_dataset.sh

The upstream repository does not state a license. These files are provided
here for research reproducibility with attribution to the original authors;
please refer to the upstream repository for its terms of use.

