===============================================================================
4. Libraries, datasets and pretrained models
===============================================================================

Third-party libraries (PyTorch, Transformers, Accelerate, PEFT, scikit-learn,
and others listed in requirements.txt) are used as dependencies and are not
redistributed.

No dataset or model weights are distributed with this repository. The datasets
(Topic3Datasets: AGNews, DBPedia, Yahoo Answers; CLINC150; Banking77; FewRel;
TACRED) and pretrained backbones (BERT, RoBERTa, Pythia, Qwen, Llama) are
subject to their own licenses and terms of use, summarized in Appendix Table 7
of the paper. TACRED is distributed by the Linguistic Data Consortium
(LDC2018T24) under the LDC user agreement.
